    "question": {
      ":question/id": "3432712b-3f33-5680-9ce8-7afd6b38ee3a",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\csc x$?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The graph has no zeroes.\n- **II.** The graph intersects the $y$-axis.\n- **III.** $y=1$ is the global minimum.",
