      ":question/worked-solution": "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\csc x.$\n\n![](images/f1/f1b80c29b8f9f4d33aae94fc287d95b97cc5865b36ecc98f4f41e625dfc842e1.png)\n\nNow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- The range of the function is $(-\\infty,-1]\\cup[1,\\infty)$.  Hence, statement I is true.\n\n- The cosecant graph does not intersect the $x$-axis. Hence, statement II is false.\n\n- The graph does not intersect the $y$-axis, as $x=0$ is not in the domain. Hence, statement III is true.",
